{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_d1a329c59974","title":"冲鸭安全","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyOTc0NDY2Nw==&mid=2247486489&idx=1&sn=eae0627a491eb3d1475280fba747bda2&chksm=c302d7355aeeadd98f467e0ff67b4036fbe8622b797698d6801dd6418c0fcea5a9cb22c01f84&scene=126&sessionid=1795488828#rd","description":"我们阻止威胁","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"冲鸭安全","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FLIUI5tJGiauANoIrA14jIOELuHIeJ7TnUIj6aicj1eerkcowXAPGz3H34oYIl0iaU3sEsrPfQGjajs%2F0","updated":"2026-10-19T14:32:09.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzkyOTc0NDY2Nw%3D%3D:2247486489:1","title":"慎用Claude code新版本(2.1.30x),会上传GIT","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyOTc0NDY2Nw==&mid=2247486489&idx=1&sn=eae0627a491eb3d1475280fba747bda2&chksm=c302d7355aeeadd98f467e0ff67b4036fbe8622b797698d6801dd6418c0fcea5a9cb22c01f84&scene=126&sessionid=1795488828#rd","description":"Claude code新版本现在加了个东西 \n\n抛开更强的中转站检测不谈，他加了一个叫做x-claude-code-wiggly-dove的字段（目前是灰度还没放量，但是很快就放了，灰度叫”tengu_wiggly_dove”)\n\n他是一个大量混淆的字段，会拼接到message里面上传，意味着你没办法在http头里面看到他\n\n解了混淆后，他会上传如下信息：\n\n如你所见，他现在会上传你的当前目录的git的URL!一键定位到哪个组织用哪个中转站开发哪个项目。\n\n猜测是如果直接分析message交互信息里面的git，一个是不合法，另外一个是数据量太大，不好定位到人（还有隐私问题）。现在是客户端直接上传字段带git地址，定位到人更方便了。并且这个无法关闭，之前的遥测还能关闭，即便是走中转站开发红队项目或者某些私有项目也会被上传到A÷服务器。\n\n建议慎用这玩意，照这个趋势，他们迟早会上传你的完整项目打包到他们服务器的。","content":"<p>Claude code新版本现在加了个东西 <br /><br />抛开更强的中转站检测不谈，他加了一个叫做x-claude-code-wiggly-dove的字段（目前是灰度还没放量，但是很快就放了，灰度叫”tengu_wiggly_dove”)<br /><br />他是一个大量混淆的字段，会拼接到message里面上传，意味着你没办法在http头里面看到他<br /><br />解了混淆后，他会上传如下信息：<br /><br />如你所见，他现在会上传你的当前目录的git的URL!一键定位到哪个组织用哪个中转站开发哪个项目。<br /><br />猜测是如果直接分析message交互信息里面的git，一个是不合法，另外一个是数据量太大，不好定位到人（还有隐私问题）。现在是客户端直接上传字段带git地址，定位到人更方便了。并且这个无法关闭，之前的遥测还能关闭，即便是走中转站开发红队项目或者某些私有项目也会被上传到A÷服务器。<br /><br />建议慎用这玩意，照这个趋势，他们迟早会上传你的完整项目打包到他们服务器的。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F1woCcbOsjVPyy9ZNmvIibnnWLDnkSNrl3pCPD1uFSne6LLO5TM1wEaeyaXBvxibibEy084SRW3VG9OoWegjbdibXgtrVrVVXLURYcLF7kpbXRv0%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F1woCcbOsjVPyy9ZNmvIibnnWLDnkSNrl3pCPD1uFSne6LLO5TM1wEaeyaXBvxibibEy084SRW3VG9OoWegjbdibXgtrVrVVXLURYcLF7kpbXRv0%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26amp%3Bfrom%3Dappmsg%26wxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F1woCcbOsjVPyy9ZNmvIibnnWLDnkSNrl3pCPD1uFSne6LLO5TM1wEaeyaXBvxibibEy084SRW3VG9OoWegjbdibXgtrVrVVXLURYcLF7kpbXRv0%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-10-19T14:32:09.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzkyOTc0NDY2Nw%3D%3D:2247486483:1","title":"慎用Claude code新版本(2.1.30x),会上传GIT URL地址","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyOTc0NDY2Nw==&mid=2247486483&idx=1&sn=17d98d23bdbd5a2a837a9ddc9c04edd1&chksm=c37f6955c23d94bfa6a69d1b038c59f34d39594f497120d5d808c5d131d9fcb9c25e0edab29a&scene=126&sessionid=1795488828#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2F1woCcbOsjVO3M9X7pFTufP6uZianibkC5AjfzTxibG63fyLyEFqKCBUZyp73BUl6PWRKaXeEvVZMsWAjeLzUQFTFacy1ialSJw4dPz8ARmicoUU0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-19T14:26:44.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzkyOTc0NDY2Nw%3D%3D:2247486477:1","title":"ClaudeCode(2.1.283)逆向和完整遥测分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyOTc0NDY2Nw==&mid=2247486477&idx=1&sn=a2e97c12935280e3d5a9fad10c500d7e&chksm=c3d8b4a145f6ed2ce94d8552ad476935dd733b90e33ff6451315d7b33c73cc738f992c7ba612&scene=126&sessionid=1795488828#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2F1woCcbOsjVOpPOM1lXypESEl7ic8gaoARHu8fC8vapI0oZTjdqfI4GqSLqyF01rTgw57v0MXMLu1EHKicft5qZRpIBoQCz3uLCGUYGtEqJL0k%2F640%3Fwxt